        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "As a registered bank holding company under the Bank Holding Company Act, we are required to file an annual report with the Federal Reserve Board and such additional information as the Federal Reserve Board may require.",
